<title>USA: China buys up to 5,000 T Brazilian soyoil-US trade.</title>
<headline>China buys up to 5,000 T Brazilian soyoil-US trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. exporters said China bought 4,000 to 5,000 tonnes of Brazilian soybean oil Monday for June shipment.</p>
<p>One exporter said China paid $508 per tonne, FOB, for 3,000 tonnes and $505 for 2,000 tonnes, all for June shipment. However, another U.S. soybean oil dealer said the deal was for 4,000 tonnes at $505 per tonne for June shipment.</p>
<p>Exporters discounted rumors in Chicago Board of Trade soybean markets of a 25,000-tonne sale Monday to China, saying the quantity was much smaller.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
